  "question": {
    "text": "The sum of all the elements of the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
